  "evidencia": "Page: Neetho. Sentence: Neetho (English: \"With You\" ) is a 2002 Telugu romance film directed by John Mahendran, starring Prakash Kovelamudi and Mahek Chahal in their debut roles.\nPage: Mahek Chahal. Sentence: Mahek Chahal (born 1 February 1979) is a Norwegian actress and model who appears in Bollywood films.\nPage: Sachein. Sentence: Based on the director's earlier Telugu film \"Neetho\" (2002), the film is produced by Kalaipuli S. Dhanu and has the score and soundtrack composed by Devi Sri Prasad.\nPage: Nayee Padosan. Sentence: Nayee Padosan (English: New Neighbour) is a 2003 Bollywood comedy film directed by cinematographer B.H. Tharun Kumar and starring Mahek Chahal, Vikas Kalantri, Anuj Sawhney and Aslam Khan in lead roles.",
