        "original_id": "bd6165a3-b850-5c05-ac3e-b30974b8d62d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Mahendran, Prakash Kovelamudi, Mahek Chahal, Kalaipuli S. Dhanu, Devi Sri Prasad, B.H. Tharun Kumar, Vikas Kalantri, Anuj Sawhney, Aslam Khan\n- Films: Neetho, Sachein, Nayee Padosan\n- Roles: director, actor, actress, model, producer, composer, cinematographer\n- Topics: Telugu cinema, Bollywood films, film debuts, remakes\n\nFacts:\n- Neetho is a 2002 Telugu romance film directed by John Mahendran.\n- Neetho stars Prakash Kovelamudi and Mahek Chahal in their debut roles.\n- Mahek Chahal, born on 1 February 1979, is a Norwegian actress and model who appears in Bollywood films.\n- Nayee Padosan is a 2003 Bollywood comedy film directed by cinematographer B.H. Tharun Kumar.\n- Nayee Padosan stars Mahek Chahal, Vikas Kalantri, Anuj Sawhney, and Aslam Khan in lead roles.\n- Sachein is based on the director's earlier 2002 Telugu film Neetho.\n- Sachein was produced by Kalaipuli S. Dhanu and has score and soundtrack composed by Devi Sri Prasad.",
